Package: kairoECS
Title: Event-Component Simulation Bindings
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("KairoECS", "Maintainers", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainers@example.com"))
Author: KairoECS Maintainers
Maintainer: KairoECS Maintainers <maintainers@example.com>
Description: R bindings for the KairoECS Rust simulation engine, currently
    exposing metadata and event-log conversion. Engine execution requires a
    qualified Rust FFI adapter; the former pure-R scheduler is retired.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Type: Package
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Suggests: arrow, devtools, jsonlite, lintr, pkgdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
